# ===========================================================================
# Self-Found Rules 
# A personal self-found ruleset for Wow Classic / TBC Anniversary,
# with the intent to build WoW characters without outside help,
# but without the fatality of hardcore mode, 
# similar to OSRS Ironman.
#
# Rules: No AH, no mail, no trading, no guild bank
# Allowed: Grouping, dungeons, professions, talents, any gear quality, dying
# ===========================================================================

# Game build that this addon targets. If it doesn't match the 
# live client, WoW flags the addon as "out of date".
# You can find the real number in-game with:
#   /dump select(4, GetBuildInfo())
