# Names a global Lua table that WoW saves to disk when You
# log out and restores when you log in.
#   SavedVariables              = shared across the account
#   SavedVariablesPerCharacter  = separate per character
# Per-character so the other alts aren't affected.
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: SFR_Data

